lity and emphasize important information on your board."," "),n.createElement("li",null,n.createElement("strong",null,"Sticky notes.")," Similar to physical sticky notes, stickies on FigJam can be placed anywhere on your board, offering a quick way to jot down ideas, notes, and to-dos or give feedback to team members."," "),n.createElement("li",null,n.createElement("strong",null,"Collaboration.")," FigJam offers tons of collaboration features, like comments, chats, stamps, stickers, and audio calls to keep teams engaged and connected."," "),n.createElement("li",null,n.createElement("strong",null,"AI.")," FigJam\u2019s Generate tool saves time by creating mind maps, flowcharts, and other diagrams based on the given prompt."," "),n.createElement("li",null,n.createElement("strong",null,"Templates.")," FigJam has over 300 pre-made templates, from meeting notes and brainstorming to strategic planning and diagramming. These templates give you a starting point to organize ideas."))),n.createElement("details",{className:t_},n.createElement("summary",null,n.createElement("span",{className:th,id:"31-how-does-the-select-button-work"},"How does the Select button work?"),n.createElement(tu.k,{className:tg})),n.createElement("p",null,"When opening a FigJam whiteboard, the cursor that pops up by default is the Select tool. The Select tool allows you to select, move, and resize any objects on your board. Simply click on the object to select it and change its properties. To select multiple objects at once, click and drag your cursor around the items you want to select. You can also select an object, then hold down the Shift key on your keyboard and click any other items you want to select."," ")),n.createElement("details",{className:t_},n.createElement("summary",null,n.createElement("span",{className:th,id:"33-how-do-i-use-the-marker-tool"},"How do I use the Marker tool?"),n.createElement(tu.k,{className:tg})),n.createElement("p",null,"To use the Marker tool on your online whiteboard, click the marker icon on the bottom toolbar. Once selected, you can change the color and thickness to your liking. Use the marker to sketch wireframes, annotate designs, create doodles, or take meeting notes directly on your whiteboard.")),n.createElement("details",{className:t_},n.createElement("summary",null,n.createElement("span",{className:th,id:"34-what-are-figjams-ai-online-whiteboard-features"},"What are FigJam\u2019s AI online whiteboard features?"),n.createElement(tu.k,{className:tg})),n.createElement("p",null,"Leverage the power of AI to help speed up and enhance your workflow with FigJam\u2019s"," ",n.createElement(td.N,{href:"https://www.figma.com/ai/"},"AI tools"),"\u2014available on any team plan."," "),n.createElement("p",null,"Here are some ways to use FigJam\u2019s AI features on your online whiteboard."),n.createElement("ul",null,n.createElement("li",null,n.createElement("strong",null,"Generate boards and diagrams.")," Save time preparing meeting agendas or building diagrams with FigJam\u2019s Generate tool. Click the Generate button on the top right navigation bar, then type your prompt or use the prompt suggestions provided to create customized boards and diagrams."," "),n.createElement("li",null,n.createElement("strong",null,"Organize and summarize stickies.")," Sticky notes can get messy during long brainstorms and design retrospectives. To keep your team\u2019s notes organized and ensure action items are met, FigJam AI can sort your stickies by theme and give you a detailed summary of your notes."," "),n.createElement("li",null,n.createElement("strong",null,"Ideate with Jambot.")," Jambot is a"," ",n.createElement(td.N,{href:"https://www.figma.com/community/widget/1274481464484630971"},"FigJam widget")," ","you can use to quickly brainstorm ideas, summarize meeting notes, create diagrams, reformat text, generate code, and more based on the prompt you provide."))),n.createElement("details",{className:t_},n.createElement("summary",null,n.createElement("span",{className:th,id:"35-how-do-sticky-notes-work"},"How do sticky notes work?"),n.createElement(tu.k,{className:tg})),n.createElement("p",null,"Similar to physical sticky notes, stickies in FigJam are useful for any quick notes, to-do lists, and other thoughts you\u2019d like to add to your board."," "),n.createElement("p",null,"Click the stack of stickies in the bottom toolbar or press S on your keyboard to add a sticky note to your board. Hover the sticky preview over the area you\u2019d like to stick your note, then click to drop the sticky."," "),n.createElement("p",null,"Click the sticky note to adjust the font size, style, and formatting, and adjust the size of the sticky by dragging any of the corners. To edit a sticky note\u2019s color, select the sticky, then choose a color in the bottom toolbar. Sticky notes automatically include your name at the bottom, making it easier to view and sort notes during group meetings."," ")),n.createElement("details",{className:t_},n.createElement("summary",null,n.createElement("span",{className:th,id:"36-how-can-i-use-the-sticky-notes-feature-on-my-online-whiteboard"},"How can I use the sticky notes feature on my online whiteboard?"),n.createElement(tu.k,{className:tg})),n.createElement("p",null,"To use the sticky notes feature, click the stack of stickies in the bottom toolbar, then click the area you want to drop the sticky. Use the popup toolbar to edit the color, font, text size, and other text formatting on your sticky note."," "),n.createElement("p",null,"Sticky notes are great for jotting down quick notes during meetings, leaving feedback on brainstorming ideas, or creating to-do lists to keep you and your team organized."," ")),n.createElement("details",{className:t_},n.createElement("summary",null,n.createElement("span",{className:th,id:"37-which-shapes-are-available-in-figjams-online-whiteboard"},"Which shapes are available in FigJam\u2019s online whiteboard?"),n.createElement(tu.k,{className:tg})),n.createElement("p",null,"Shapes are useful for building diagrams, user journeys, site maps, or flowcharts on your online whiteboard. Anyone with editing access can add the following default shapes to their board:"," "),n.createElement("ul",null,n.createElement("li",null,"Square "),n.createElement("li",null,"Eclipse "),n.createElement("li",null,"Diamond "),n.createElement("li",null,"Triangle "),n.createElement("li",null,"Downward-pointing triangle "),n.createElement("li",null,"Rounded rectangle "),n.createElement("li",null,"Chevron "),n.createElement("li",null,"Mind map "),n.createElement("li",null,"Predefined process "),n.createElement("li",null,"Document "),n.createElement("li",null,"Multiple documents "),n.createElement("li",null,"Manual input "),n.createElement("li",null,"Hexagon "),n.createElement("li",null,"Right-leaning parallelogram "),n.createElement("li",null,"Left-leaning parallelogram "),n.createElement("li",null,"Cylinder "),n.createElement("li",null,"Horizontal cylinder "),n.createElement("li",null,"Internal storage "),n.createElement("li",null,"Trapezoid "),n.createElement("li",null,"Summing junction "),n.createElement("li",null,"Shield "),n.createElement("li",null,"Or "),n.createElement("li",null,"Folder "),n.createElement("li",null,"File "),n.createElement("li",null,"Pentagon "),n.createElement("li",null,"Octagon "),n.createElement("li",null,"Plus "),n.createElement("li",null,"Left arrow "),n.createElement("li",null,"Right arrow "),n.createElement("li",null,"Star speech bubble"))),n.createElement("details",{className:t_},n.createElement("summary",null,n.createElement("span",{className:th,id:"38-i-need-extra-tools-and-features-for-my-work-how-can-i-access-more-functionalities"},"I need extra tools and features for my work. How can I access more functionalities?"),n.createElement(tu.k,{className:tg})),n.createElement("p",null,"FigJam offers additional tools and functionalities to streamline your workflow, including:"," "),n.createElement("ul",null,n.createElement("li",null,n.createElement("strong",null,"Plugins and widgets.")," Find the"," ",n.createElement(td.N,{href:"https://www.figma.com/community/design-tools?resource_type=plugins"},"plugin")," ","or"," ",n.createElement(td.N,{href:"https://www.figma.com/community/whiteboarding?resource_type=widgets"},"widget")," ","you need to make your FigJam experience more enjoyable and efficient. For example, the"," ",n.createElement(td.N,{href:"https://www.figma.com/community/widget/1274481464484630971"},"Jambot widget")," ","leverages AI technology to help you brainstorm creative ideas, gather more information on a topic, write code, summarize content, and more."," "),n.createElement("li",null,n.createElement("strong",null,"Integrations.")," FigJam integrates with various project management, design, and development tools like"," ",n.createElement(td.N,{href:"https://www.figma.com/asana-for-figma/"},"Asana")," and"," ",n.createElement(td.N,{href:"https://www.figma.com/github-for-figjam/"},"GitHub")," to keep projects moving smoothly."," "),n.createElement("li",null,n.createElement("strong",null,"Community resources.")," Browse the Figma Community to explore additional templates, plugins, and tools to use with FigJam\u2019s online whiteboard, like personalizing team boards with"," ",n.createElement(td.N,{href:"https://www.figma.com/community/widget/1151936790942917527/Bitmoji"},"Bitmojis.")))))}function tE(){return n.createElement("div",{className:tm},n.createElement("h1",{className:tp,id:"managing-your-online-whiteboard"},n.createElement("strong",null,"Managing your online whiteboard")),n.createElement("details",{className:t_}," ",n.createElement("summary",null,n.createElement("span",{className:th,id:"40-how-do-i-save-my-board"},"How do I save my board?"),n.createElement(tu.k,{className:tg})),n.createElement("p",null,"Since FigJam is an online tool, your whiteboards will automatically save under your Files in your Figma account\u2014no need to worry about saving your board after making any updates and changes. You can view any of your whiteboards under the Recents or Drafts tab of your Figma files for easy access."," ")),n.createElement("details",{className:t_}," ",n.createElement("summary",null,n.createElement("span",{className:th,id:"41-how-do-i-delete-my-online-whiteboard"},"How do I delete my online whiteboard?"),n.createElement(tu.k,{className:tg})),n.createElement("p",null,"To delete your online whiteboard, click the Figma logo on the top left menu bar, then click Back to files. From there, you should see your whiteboards under the Drafts tab. Right-click the whiteboard you want to delete, then hit Delete file. If you have edit access, you can restore any deleted files from the Deleted section of the Drafts tab."," ")),n.createElement("details",{className:t_}," ",n.createElement("summary",null,n.createElement("span",{className:th,id:"42-how-can-i-delete-the-content-i-created-on-my-online-whiteboard"},"How can I delete the content I created on my online whiteboard?"),n.createElement(tu.k,{className:tg})),n.createElement("p",null,"To delete any content or objects from your online whiteboard, select the item you want to delete, then right-click and hit Delete or use the Delete button on your keyboard. To delete an entire board, go to your Figma files, navigate to the Drafts tab, right-click the whiteboard you want to delete, and then hit Delete."," ")),n.createElement("details",{className:t_}," ",n.createElement("summary",null,n.createElement("span",{className:th,id:"44-can-i-access-the-virtual-whiteboard-again-at-a-later-point"},"Can I access the virtual whiteboard again at a later point?"),n.createElement(tu.k,{className:tg})),n.createElement("p",null,"Your virtual whiteboard is saved and ready for you to access at any time. When looking for a board, go to your Figma files, and look for your board under the Drafts tab. You can also type the board name into the search bar to find the board you\u2019re looking for."," ")),n.createElement("details",{className:t_}," ",n.createElement("summary",null,n.createElement("span",{className:th,id:"45-how-can-i-create-an-identical-copy-of-my-online-whiteboard"},"How can I create an identical copy of my online whiteboard?"),n.createElement(tu.k,{className:tg})),n.createElement("p",null,"To duplicate and make a copy of your whiteboard, navigate to the menu bar in the top left corner. Click the dropdown arrow next to the whiteboard title, then click Duplicate. This will make a duplicate copy of your board and automatically save it to your drafts."," ")),n.createElement("details",{className:t_}," ",n.createElement("summary",null,n.createElement("span",{className:th,id:"46-how-do-i-share-an-online-whiteboard"},"How do I share an online whiteboard?"),n.createElement(tu.k,{className:tg})),n.createElement("p",null,"The easiest way to share your online whiteboard is to send collaborators a share link. Click the Share button at the top right corner of your whiteboard, then select the Copy button. You can also invite additional collaborators via email, which you\u2019ll find via the same Share button."," "),n.createElement("p",null,"If you\u2019d like to allow collaborators to edit your whiteboard, update the permission settings to \u201CCan edit.\u201D This allows other team members to move, edit, and add objects to the board while giving them access to other FigJam collaboration features like running voting sessions or starting timers."," ")),n.createElement("details",{className:t_}," ",n.createElement("summary",null,n.createElement("span",{className:th,id:"48-how-do-i-export-my-online-whiteboards"},"How do I export my online whiteboards?"),n.createElement(tu.k,{className:tg})),n.createElement("p",null,"To export your online whiteboards, click the Figma icon on the menu bar in the top left corner, then navigate to File and click Export as. From there, you\u2019ll have the option to export your board as a PNG, JPG, PDF, or CSV. You can also choose a solid, grid, or transparent background when exporting the file, but options may differ depending on the file type."," "),n.createElement("p",null,"If you only want to export a portion of your board, select the items you want to export, then right-click and choose Export selection."," ")),n.createElement("details",{className:t_}," ",n.createElement("summary",null,n.createElement("span",{className:th,id:"49-can-other-users-export-my-online-whiteboards"},"Can other users export my online whiteboards?"),n.createElement(tu.k,{className:tg})),n.createElement("p",null,"Other users can export your online whiteboards if they have editing access. To check your access permissions, click the Share button in the top right corner of your whiteboard and change the edit toggle on for any team member you\u2019d like to grant editing access."," ")),n.createElement("details",{className:t_}," ",n.createElement("summary",null,n.createElement("span",{className:th,id:"50-how-can-other-people-collaborate-on-the-whiteboard"},"How can other people collaborate on the whiteboard?"),n.createElement(tu.k,{className:tg})),n.createElement("p",null,"FigJam\u2019s online whiteboard offers tons of collaboration features to get your whole team involved. Some collaboration features to explore include:"," "),n.createElement("ul",null,n.createElement("li",null,n.createElement("strong",null,"Comments, mentions, and chat.")," Use the comment feature to ask questions or provide feedback anywhere on the board. Use the @ symbol to tag other collaborators and type a message in the selected field. You can also add media to a comment by dragging and dropping a file or clicking the image icon."," "),n.createElement("li",null,n.createElement("strong",null,"Stamps, emotes, and high-fives.")," Offer visual feedback to team members with these features. Click anywhere on the board and use the stamp tool to leave a sticker of your choice, or select the emote tool to leave temporary emoji reactions."," "),n.createElement("li",null,n.createElement("strong",null,"Cursor chat.")," This feature is great for quick communication, allowing you to leave live, temporary messages to other collaborators. When cursor chat is on, your chat bubble will appear next to your cursor and team members can see your message as you\u2019re typing."," "),n.createElement("li",null,n.createElement("strong",null,"Audio call.")," FigJam\u2019s audio feature is great for quick conversations and casual chats during meetings. Click the headphone icon next to your profile avatar, then click Start Conversation. Any collaborators with access to the board can join live conversations by clicking the same icon."," "),n.createElement("li",null,n.createElement("strong",null,"Spotlight.")," This feature allows any collaborators to see your view of the board, which is helpful when running quick audio calls for meetings and workshops. Hover over your avatar, then click Spotlight Me, and an invitation will be sent to any collaborator viewing the file.")),n.createElement("p",null,"Collaborators with view access can use most of these collaboration features, but if you\u2019d like to give anyone the ability to move, add, or edit objects on the whiteboard or have access to Community resources like stickers and libraries, make sure your users\u2019 access is set to \u201CCan edit.\u201D"," ")),n.createElement("details",{className:t_}," ",n.createElement("summary",null,n.createElement("span",{className:th,id:"51-can-other-users-draw-on-and-edit-the-contents-of-the-online-whiteboard"},"Can other users draw on and edit the contents of the online whiteboard?"),n.createElement(tu.k,{className:tg})),n.createElement("p",null,"Yes! Anyone with editing access can use FigJam\u2019s drawing tools and edit, move, or change the order of objects on the whiteboard. Collaborators can also use features like stamps and emotes to leave visual feedback and reactions to content on the whiteboard."," ")),n.createElement("details",{className:t_}," ",n.createElement("summary",null,n.createElement("span",{className:th,id:"52-can-others-edit-my-virtual-whiteboard"},"Can others edit my virtual whiteboard?"),n.createElement(tu.k,{className:tg})),n.createElement("p",null,"Yes! If you\u2019d like to invite other collaborators to edit your online whiteboard, send them a share link or invite them via email. Check your permission settings and make sure collaborators have \u201CCan edit\u201D access, allowing them to edit, move, and rearrange any objects on your board."," ")),n.createElement("details",{className:t_}," ",n.createElement("summary",null,n.createElement("span",{className:th,id:"53-how-can-others-view-my-figjam-online-whiteboard"},"How can others view my FigJam online whiteboard?"),n.createElement(tu.k,{className:tg})),n.createElement("p",null,"Share your online whiteboard by sending other people a share link or inviting them via email. Make sure the \u201CCan view\u201D settings are turned on, which also gives viewers access to FigJam\u2019s collaboration features while viewing your board, like adding comments, mentions, or emotes."," ")))}function ty(){return n.createElement("div",{className:tm},n.createElement("h1",{className:tp,id:"online-whiteboard-templates"},n.createElement("strong",null,"Online whiteboard templates")),n.createElement("details",{className:t_},n.createElement("summary",null,n.createElement("span",{className:th,id:"54-does-the-online-diagram-tool-offer-ready-made-templates"},"Does the online diagram tool offer ready-made templates?"),n.createElement(tu.k,{className:tg})),n.createElement("p",null,"FigJam offers tons of pre-made"," ",n.createElement(td.N,{href:"https://www.figma.com/templates/diagramming/"},"diagramming templates")," ","that are easy to edit and customize to fit your needs. Browse Figma\u2019s template library to find the one you need or open a diagram template on your whiteboard by clicking the Template button in the top right menu bar."," ")),n.createElement("details",{className:t_